{
 "about": "A week of chat between 阿青 (the human, role user) and 小满 (the AI, role assistant), the two people of the dev panel's sample library (scripts/dev_panel.py seed). Day one is the day the sample is seeded: 阿青 has just finished an exam, the beach is planned for Saturday at eight, the dentist moved to Sunday, the bike waits for a part, 小林 has one more interview round next week. Replayed by scripts/replay_week.py.",
